What is derived, specifically:

  - the theme file format. skeins reads btop's own `.theme` files as they
    are, so a palette written for btop works here unmodified.
  - the preset syntax, `box:P:G,box:P:G`, read out of btop_config.cpp,
    including its limits of nine presets of at most four boxes.
  - the design language: per-box outline colours, state stated in the border,
    controls hung off the frame, and the menu placed beside the box name.

No btop source code is included in this work.
